      "statement": "`DeepAgentRuntime` owns Deep Agents graph construction: it combines filesystem middleware, the built-in clock, conditionally included progress tools, configured runtime tools, optional archive and cron tools, approval tools, subagents, and optional web/help capabilities before the host invokes it through `AgentRequest`.",
